+### `constantCase`
+
+Splits string and joins by CONSTANT_CASE (a.k.a. SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE) convention:
+
+```ts
+constantCase("fooBar");
+// FOO_BAR
+
+constantCase("foo-bar_baz");
+// FOO_BAR_BAZ
+```
+
 ### `flatCase`
 
